    {
      "source": "Implementations should provide a subclass registered with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> and\noverride the <a href=\"#match(org.springframework.core.type.classreading.MetadataReader,org.springframework.core.type.classreading.MetadataReaderFactory)\"><code>match(MetadataReader, MetadataReaderFactory)</code></a> method. They should\nalso implement a valid <a href=\"#hashCode()\"><code>hashCode</code></a> and <a href=\"#equals(java.lang.Object)\"><code>equals</code></a>\nmethods so that they can be used as part of Spring test's application context caches.",
      "translation": "实现应提供一个与<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>注册的子类，并覆盖<a href=\"#match(org.springframework.core.type.classreading.MetadataReader,org.springframework.core.type.classreading.MetadataReaderFactory)\"><code>match(MetadataReader, MetadataReaderFactory)</code></a>方法。它们还应实现有效的<a href=\"#hashCode()\"><code>hashCode</code></a>和<a href=\"#equals(java.lang.Object)\"><code>equals</code></a>方法，以便将其用作 Spring 测试应用程序上下文的缓存的一部分。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that <code>TypeExcludeFilters</code> are initialized very early in the application\nlifecycle, they should generally not have dependencies on any other beans. They are\nprimarily used internally to support <code>spring-boot-test</code>.",
      "translation": "请注意，`TypeExcludeFilters` 在应用程序生命周期中非常早期就被初始化，因此它们通常不应依赖于任何其他 Bean。它们主要用于内部支持 `spring-boot-test`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
